      "expected": "The specification says the 3.3 V LDO supplies the MCUs. The MCU VDD pins should be connected to the regulated 3.3 V rail, and the MCU supply rail must be connected to the LDO output.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"+3.3V\") ... (node (ref \"REG2\") (pin \"1\") (pinfunction \"OUT\"))"
